/de/ayah/18-101.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/18-101.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Kahf 18:101 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"(Iaitu) orang-orang yang matanya telah tertutup daripada melihat tanda-tanda yang membawa kepada mengingatiKu, dan mereka pula tidak dapat mendengar sama s\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Laman utama\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Kahf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/18.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 101\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/18-101.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/18.html\">Surah Al-Kahf</a> › Ayat 101</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Kahf 18:101</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿الَّذِينَ كَانَتْ أَعْيُنُهُمْ فِي غِطَاءٍ عَن ذِكْرِي وَكَانُوا لَا يَسْتَطِيعُونَ سَمْعًا﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">(Iaitu) orang-orang yang matanya telah tertutup daripada melihat tanda-tanda yang membawa kepada mengingatiKu, dan mereka pula tidak dapat mendengar sama sekali.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وأما على تفسير السلف والجمهور فالمراد بعدم الاستطاعة مشقة ذلك عليهم وصعوبته على نفوسهم، فنفوسهم لا تستطيع إرادته؛ وإن كانوا قادرين على فعله لو أرادوه<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 3/319</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهذه حال من صده هواه ورأيه الفاسد عن استماع كتب الله المنزلة واتباعها: فقد أخبر أنه لا يستطيع ذلك<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 3/319</cite></blockquote></section><section><h2>Imam Ibnu al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهذا يتضمن معنيين أحدهما: أن أعينهم في غطاء عما تضمنه الذكر من آيات الله وأدلة توحيده<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/93</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s18a101\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/18-97.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (18:97)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/18-102.html\">Ayat seterusnya (18:102)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/18-102.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Kahf 18:102 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Maka adakah orang-orang kafir menyangka bahawa mereka mengambil hamba-hambaKu sebagai makhluk-makhluk yang disembah, selain daripadaKu, dapat menolong mere\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/18-102.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir Al-Kahf 18:102 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Maka adakah orang-orang kafir menyangka bahawa mereka mengambil hamba-hambaKu sebagai makhluk-makhluk yang disembah, selain daripadaKu, dapat menolong mere\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Laman utama\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Surah Al-Kahf\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/surah/18.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Ayat 102\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/18-102.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> › <a href=\"/ms/surah/18.html\">Surah Al-Kahf</a> › Ayat 102</nav><h1>Tafsir Surah Al-Kahf 18:102</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿أَفَحَسِبَ الَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا أَن يَتَّخِذُوا عِبَادِي مِن دُونِي أَوْلِيَاءَ إِنَّا أَعْتَدْنَا جَهَنَّمَ لِلْكَافِرِينَ نُزُلًا﴾</p><section><h3>Terjemahan makna</h3><p class=\"tr\">Maka adakah orang-orang kafir menyangka bahawa mereka mengambil hamba-hambaKu sebagai makhluk-makhluk yang disembah, selain daripadaKu, dapat menolong mereka? Sesungguhnya Kami telah sediakan neraka Jahannam bagi orang-orang kafir itu sebagai tempat tetamu.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Malay Translation - Abdullah Basumayyah — v1.0.0 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Kata-kata kedua-dua imam dipaparkan dalam bahasa Arab asal, kata demi kata, berserta rujukan.</p><section><h2>Syeikhul Islam Ibnu Taimiyah</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">إن المراد به الملائكة والأنبياء إذا كان قد نهى عن اتخاذهم أولياء فغيرهم بطريق الأولى<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 1/44</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ms#s18a102\">Buka dalam tafsir interaktif (teks penuh)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ms/ayah/18-101.html\">Ayat sebelumnya (18:101)</a><a href=\"/ms/ayah/18-109.html\">Ayat seterusnya (18:109)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Syaikhain · <a href=\"/ms/\">Laman utama</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Tentang projek</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privasi &amp; terma</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/18-109.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ms\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir Al-Kahf 18:109 — menurut Ibnu Taimiyah dan Ibnu al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Katakanlah (wahai Muhammad): “Kalaulah semua jenis lautan menjadi tinta untuk menulis Kalimah-kalimah Tuhanku, sudah tentu akan habis kering lautan itu seb\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/18-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/18-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/18-109.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com